  "word_count": 1042,
  "body_markdown": "Skip to content\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4 Dental Implants\n\nFixed Teeth vs. Removable\n\nCost & Compare\n\nDental Implant FAQ\n\nAesthetics\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\nDental Crowns & Bridges\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nTreatments\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nOral Surgery\n\nEmergency Dentistry\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nSmile Gallery\n\nWho We Are\n\nWhy Choose Us\n\nMeet Dr. Esam Nahlah\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nPatient Stories\n\nFor Doctors\n\nReferral Form\n\nContact Us\n\nBlog\n\nCurrent Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria: (703) 940-5410\n\nNew Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (571) 619-9442\n\nAlexandria: (571) 410-3430\n\nBook now\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n###### Gentle Sedation Dentistry in McLean, VA\n\n\n\n# World-Class, Anxiety-Free Dental Care\n\n\nSchedule Now\n\n\n# Sedation Dentistry - McLean, VA\n\n\n\n## World-Class, Anxiety-Free Dental Care\n\n\n\n## Scared About Seeing the Dentist? Don't Be.\n\n\nMany patients dread going to the dentist, but in today’s age of modern dentistry, there is little need to be nervous, anxious or scared about an upcoming visit to the dentist’s office. At Dental Group of Tysons in McLean, VA, we go above and beyond to make you feel comfortable, secure, and anxiety-free – no matter the dental procedure you need. Dr. Esam Nahlah and his team of dental experts take every step necessary to ensure that your treatments and procedures are as safe, comfortable and pain-free as possible. We offer several dental sedation options to make your experience a positive one, including IV sedation, oral sedation and nitrous oxide sedation. We believe nothing should get in the way of quality dental care, which is why we’re here to speak with you about easing your dental fears and getting you into the office for the care and treatment you need.\n\n\n## Are You in Need of Sedation Dentistry?\n\n\nAre you scared of going to the dentist?\n\nDo you suffer from dental anxiety?\n\nDo you have an overly sensitive gag reflex?\n\nDo you have a low tolerance for pain?\n\nAre you in need of multiple treatments and/or surgeries?\n\n\n## Sedation Options at Dental Group of Tysons\n\n\n\n#### Oral and IV Sedation\n\n\nDepending on the extent of your treatment and/or your personal health, we use a medical anesthesiologist to administer either oral or IV sedation options at Dental Group of Tysons. IV sedation is typically the strongest type of sedation available, and is reserved for patients who suffer from severe dental anxiety. Both oral and IV sedation typically require arrangement of transportation to and from your dental appointment.\n\n\n#### Nitrous Oxide Sedation\n\n\nCommonly referred to as “laughing gas,” nitrous oxide is a common dental sedation option that is typically milder than IV and oral sedation options. Some patients do, however, fall asleep in the chair (which may be exactly what you want!). Not only are the effects of nitrous sedation faster-acting than oral and IV options, but nitrous oxide typically requires shorter recovery times, as well, allowing patients to drive themselves home after their procedure in most cases.\n\n\n## Don't Let Your Dental Anxiety Stand in the Way\n\n\nNo matter how much you may suffer from dental anxiety, don’t let your fears get in the way of receiving the oral care and treatment you need. Adequate oral health can even have major repercussions on the health and well-being of your entire body. In fact, gum disease and other types of oral disease can increase your risk of a number of physical health complications, such as diabetes, stroke and cardiovascular disease. If you prolong dental treatment due to fear or anxiety, you may be putting your physiological health at risk in ways that you’re not even aware of.\n\nAt Dental Group of Tysons in McLean, VA, we are here to ensure that your treatment is as comfortable and pain-free as possible. We also offer affordable financing and payment options, as we believe no one should go without receiving the dental care and treatments they need in order to live a happy, healthy life. Get in touch with our team today and speak with one of our professionals about dental sedation options that can make your trip to Dental Group of Tysons a quick, easy and painless one!\n\n\n## Quality Oral Care, Without the Anxiety.\n\n\nSchedule with Dental Group of Tysons in McLean, VA today for safe, convenient, state-of-the-art dental care.\n\nBook Now\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddresses:\n\nTysons Corner\n\n7901 Jones Branch Dr., Suite 220\n\nMcLean, VA 22102\n\nNew Patients: (571) 619-9442\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria\n\n2855 Duke St,\n\nAlexandria, VA 22314\n\nNew Patients: (571) 410-3430\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 940-5410\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 8:00am – 2:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\nAll-On-4® Implants\n\nCrowns & Bridges\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nMeet the Doctor\n\nAbout Us\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\n2025 Dr. Nahlah. All rights reserved",
